#: ../../library/pyb.Pin.rst:68
msgid ""
"Create a new Pin object associated with the given ``id``. If additional "
"arguments are given they are forwarded to :meth:`Pin.init` to configure the "
"pin."
msgstr ""
"Skapa ett nytt Pin-objekt kopplat till det angivna ``id``\\ . Om ytterligare"
" argument anges vidarebefordras de till :meth:`Pin.init` för att konfigurera"
" stiftet."

